# From original_saves/early-game-seed-100/TURN1.SAV (England, Spring 1492, turn 0) re-saved once
# by the port, no fixture edits. The human's only unit is the Caravel at sea (43,28) carrying
# 100 Tools and a Veteran Soldier (both sentried aboard). The Caravel is sentried and the human
# idles six turns while France, Spain and the Dutch sail in, land and found their first
# colonies (colony_count 0 -> 3), natives and the Europe market move. Whole-game drift guard.
key s                      # sentry the Caravel: no unit left, the turn ends by itself (1492 -> 1493)
wait 300
key space                  # End of Turn (Spring 1494)
wait 300
key space                  # End of Turn (Spring 1495)
wait 300
key space                  # End of Turn (Spring 1496)
wait 300
shot
key Return                 # Religious unrest in England: Master Carpenters available in London
wait 60
shot
key Return                 # Master Carpenters ready on the London docks
wait 60
shot
key space                  # End of Turn (Spring 1497)
wait 300
shot
key space                  # End of Turn (Spring 1498)
wait 300
shot
